{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "nodeID": "62",
   "text": "Does a purchase-commitment deal push China back toward managed trade?",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "question",
   "toulmin": "framing",
   "oper": "framing",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#Q"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "63",
   "text": "Tariffs and quotas do not matter much when the bulk of imports are bought by state firms or need a state licence",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "stated_assumption",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.prior",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#P1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "64",
   "text": "China will not dismantle the core institutions of its mixed model in a trade negotiation",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "stated_assumption",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.prior",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#P2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "65",
   "text": "The definitional move the argument turns on - 'that's managed trade in my books, even without formal tariffs or quotas'",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "hidden_assumption",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.prior",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#P3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "66",
   "text": "Trade stopped without any formal tariff being introduced",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#D1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "67",
   "text": "No dumping case and no national-security tariff case was filed",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#D2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "68",
   "text": "A 25% tariff would normally cut imports by something like 50%; several U.S. goods simply stopped",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#D3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "69",
   "text": "State-owned airlines plus one state-backed private carrier, with NDRC approval required; China is both Boeing's biggest market and, through COMAC, a future competitor",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#D4"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "70",
   "text": "The old state grain monopoly still controls crushing and distribution, Sinograin steps in from stockpiles, and smaller importers need a state licence",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#D5"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "71",
   "text": "They own the pipelines and the bulk of refining; private LNG terminals exist but the offshore investors are state firms",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#D6"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "72",
   "text": "Telecoms equipment, railway equipment, grid power, avionics - in sector after sector the ultimate buyer is the Chinese state",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#D7"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "73",
   "text": "When the state controls the importing firms, a few phone calls move trade without any border measure",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#M1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "74",
   "text": "GE could own its turbine plant outright and still have to sell to state-run power companies selling to the state grid",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#M2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "75",
   "text": "Rolls-Royce would build engines in China to win the contract; Airbus may build the A330 there - so import demand falls as capacity moves in",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#M3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "76",
   "text": "Because the control is not legal but ownership-based, what it grants it can also withdraw",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#M4"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "77",
   "text": "So a purchase deal cannot return it to a place it never left",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#C1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "78",
   "text": "Open to components for re-export and to what China cannot make at home; closed where the state is the buyer",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#C2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "79",
   "text": "Not even dropping joint-venture requirements changes who the end buyer is",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#C3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "80",
   "text": "The objection is not that the deal reintroduces state involvement, but that it is revocable",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#C4"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "81",
   "text": "China's state never stopped managing a large part of its trade, so the sound objection is Book's and Scissors': 'if it can be negotiated by government fiat, it can be taken away by government fiat'",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "main_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.final",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#K"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "82",
   "text": "Yerxa, Donnan and almost everyone at the IMF Spring meetings - simplistic purchasing commitments reinforce state ownership rather than discourage it",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "opposing_view",
   "toulmin": "rebuttal",
   "oper": "rebuttal",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#X"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "83",
   "text": "The one sector where the state is not the main buyer. Tariffs were 25% and are still 15%, domestic capacity could meet all demand, yet German marques built a real business - because cars are bought privately",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "other_explanation",
   "toulmin": "rebuttal",
   "oper": "rebuttal",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#R1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "84",
   "text": "This is a description of the world as it is, not as it should be; and medical equipment is a trick case, with private hospitals and local-government procurement",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "caveat",
   "toulmin": "qualifier",
   "oper": "qualifier",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#QF"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "85",
   "text": "Australia and others argue the United States is selling out its allies for a larger share of a limited import pie",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "opposing_view",
   "toulmin": "rebuttal",
   "oper": "rebuttal",
   "localID": "setser_may_2_19#R2"
  },
